I'm noticing there's an issue with potential call duplication. I had planned for 120,000, but I'm only able to emit 1,000 due to tool constraints. It seems like there might be a system time or approval cap involved, but I don't think that's the case. I really need to set it to 30,000 instead. Let's adjust that and see if it helps!
