**Analyzing tool constraints**

I’m wondering, is >120 seconds really enough? I feel like I may have spent over 60 seconds just waiting for the model to respond. If the tool can wait without any issues, it might not matter much. I think I need to make that deliberate change argument stronger, possibly using 300,000 instead of just 1,000. I need to clarify this as I move forward.
